    context: "Adobe work"
    description: "I helped prototype the new Color Mode in Premiere - these brand new color-grading tools for video editors won over NAB for best of show"
    url: "https://www.adobe.com/products/premiere/color-mode.html"
    image: "/images/work/premiere-color-mode.webp"
    imageWidth: 1400
    imageHeight: 883
    alt: "Premiere Color Mode showing a before-and-after color grade and color controls"
    moreUrl: "/work/adobe/"
    moreLabel: "More Adobe work"
  - title: "Self Composed"
    context: "Museum installations"
    description: "A two-camera portrait installation for SFMOMA. I worked on the development team, connecting the print server to the interface."
    url: "/blog/2016-10-16-selfcomposed/"
    image: "/images/work/self-composed.webp"
    imageWidth: 1024
    imageHeight: 683
    alt: "Visitors using the Self Composed installations at SFMOMA"
    moreUrl: "/work/installations/"
